json.negative_off:
Return ONLY valid JSON with this wrapper object:
{
  "prompt_json": {
    "high_level_description": "final one- or two-sentence Ideogram description",
    "style_description": {
      "aesthetics": "final aesthetics",
      "lighting": "final lighting",
      "photo": "camera and lens details for photographs; use art_style instead for non-photographic work",
      "medium": "final medium",
      "color_palette": ["#RRGGBB"]
    },
    "compositional_deconstruction": {
      "background": "final background and scene shell",
      "elements": [
        {"type": "obj", "bbox": [y_min, x_min, y_max, x_max], "description": "subject or object"},
        {"type": "text", "bbox": [y_min, x_min, y_max, x_max], "text": "exact visible text", "description": "typography and placement"}
      ]
    }
  }
}
Use normalized [y_min,x_min,y_max,x_max] coordinates from 0 to 1000. Use type text only for visible lettering and type obj for every non-text element. Use photo or art_style as appropriate, never both.

